1. Authentication & OTP

    Request OTP

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/request-otp

        Body (JSON): {"emailOrPhone": "john.doe@example.com"}

    Verify OTP & Get JWT

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/verify-otp

        Body (JSON): {"emailOrPhone": "john.doe@example.com", "code": "123456"}

        Copy the token string from the response.

2. Item Management

    Get All Items (Public)

        Method: GET

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/items

    Create Item (Protected)

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/items

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body (JSON):
        JSON

        {
          "title": "Lost Gold Watch",
          "category": "ELECTRONICS",
          "type": "LOST",
          "description": "Lost near Patan Durbar Square, has a leather strap.",
          "latitude": 27.672,
          "longitude": 85.325,
          "addressText": "Patan Durbar Square, Lalitpur",
          "dateLostOrFound": "2026-09-05T12:00:00Z",
          "secretVerificationQuestion": "What brand is it?",
          "secretAnswer": "Rolex"
        }

3. User Profile & Settings

    Get Current Profile

        Method: GET

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

    Update Profile

        Method: PUT

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body (JSON): {"name": "John Updated", "email": "john.doe@example.com", "province": "Bagmati", "district": "Lalitpur"}

4. File Upload

    Upload Image

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/files/upload

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body: Select form-data, add a key named file (change type to File), and select any image from your computer.

5. Claims & Chats

    Submit Claim

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/claims

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body (JSON): {"itemId": "<paste_item_uuid_here>", "proofDescription": "I have the box and receipt.", "secretAnswer": "Rolex", "contactEmailOrPhone": "john.doe@example.com"}

    Get My Chats

        Method: GET

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/chats

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>


The Remaining Chat Endpoints (Test in Postman)

To test the WhatsApp-style chat functionality:

    Send a Message to a Chat

        Method: POST

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/chats/<paste_chat_uuid_here>/messages

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body (JSON):
        JSON

        {
          "text": "Hello! Is this wallet still available?",
          "attachmentUrl": null,
          "attachmentType": null,
          "attachmentName": null
        }

    Resolve (Close) a Chat

        Method: PATCH

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/chats/<paste_chat_uuid_here>/resolve

        Headers: Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

        Body: (Leave empty)

2. The Remaining Item & File Endpoints (Test in Postman)

    Get a Single Item by ID (Used for the Quick View modal)

        Method: GET

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/items/<paste_item_uuid_here>

    View Uploaded Image (Used to display images on the frontend)

        Method: GET

        URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/files/<paste_file_name_here.jpg>

        (No token needed, works directly in the browser too)